description	"Jedi Master Shaak Ti

A tactical Jedi master who synergizes well with clones.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Purple/Blue/Yellow/Red Style)
-- Cripples/Disarms/Knocks Back On Hit
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- 300% more special damage
-- All Styles Lower Damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (3)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS3]
- Repulse (1) ^3[CS4]
-- Lifts/Tracks/Cripples On Damage Done
- Stasis (1)
- Force Energize (1)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Rally
- Force Focus (3)
- 45% More Knockback Given
- Blast Armour
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
- Force Interface (Use Distance +10)
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Force Block (1)
- Health Healing (Capped at 35)
- Stat Viewer

^8Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Instruct (Force/Block Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]"